  "prefLabel": "He-P 807.02 Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2019-08-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 807.02 Scope. This part shall apply to any individual, agency, partnership, corporation, government entity, association, or other legal entity operating a RTRF, except:\n\n(a) All facilities listed in RSA 151:2, II(a)-(i); and\n\n(b) All facilities which are owned or operated by the state of New Hampshire, pursuant to RSA 151:2, II(i).\n\nSource. #9873-A, eff 2-24-11; ss by #12727, INTERIM, eff 2-20-19, EXPIRED: 8-19-19\n\nNew. #12962, eff 12-31-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p800.html"
